# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: src/wasm-pkg/* is a build artifact, and the
# wasm-bindgen version in the lockfile must match the CLI that generated its JS
# glue. See README "Rust WebAssembly".

# Keep WASM files for deployment
!src/wasm-pkg/
